---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Runs reviewed down.sql files, newest first. Stop application writers and back up the database before using this command

Usage: leptoskit db rollback [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --service <NAME>  Work on the database of the service `[services.<name>]` declares, with its crate's tables and migrations, rather than the app's
      --url <URL>       Database URL; defaults to `db.url_env`
      --steps <STEPS>   Number of applied migrations to reverse [default: 1]
      --yes             Confirm reverse SQL may delete data
  -h, --help            Print help
  -V, --version         Print version
